[00:04.06] I don't want your millions, mister.
[00:26.40] I don't want your diamond ring.
[00:30.82] All I want is the right to live mister.
[00:31.08] Give me back my job again.
[00:31.08] I don't want your Rolls Royce, mister,
[00:31.08] I don't want your pleasure yacht,
[00:33.94] All I want is food for my babies,
[00:34.74] Now give to me my old job back.
[00:34.74] I don't want your millions, mister.
[00:34.74] I don't want your diamond ring.
[00:35.54] All I want is the right to live mister.
[00:42.10] Give me back my job again.
[01:02.88] We worked to build this country, mister,
[01:03.96] While you enjoyed a life of ease.
[01:08.30] You've stolen all that we've built, mister,
[01:22.18] Now our children starve and freeze.
[01:22.18] I don't want your millions, mister.
[01:26.62] I don't want your diamond ring.
[01:30.56] All I want is the right to live mister.
[01:35.60] Give me back my job again.
[01:49.50] Yes, you have a land deed, mister,
[01:56.24] The money is all in your name.
[02:01.36] But where's the work that you did, mister?
[02:10.64] I'm demanding back my job again.
[02:16.42] I don't want your millions, mister.
[02:18.90] I don't want your diamond ring.
[02:19.72] All I want is the right to live mister.
[02:21.24] Give me back my job again.
[02:21.30] Think me dumb if you wish, mister,
[02:21.30] Call me green or blue or red.
[02:21.44] There's just one thing that I know, mister,
[02:21.44] Our hungry babies must be fed.
[02:21.44] I don't want your millions, mister.
[02:21.44] I don't want your diamond ring.
[02:21.44] All I want is the right to live mister.
[02:21.70] Give me back my job again.
[02:21.84] We'll organize together, mister,
[02:21.84] In one big united band,
[02:22.02] And with a Farmer-Labor party
[02:22.02] We will win our just demands.
[02:22.08] I don't want your millions, mister.
[02:22.08] I don't want your diamond ring.
[02:22.08] All I want is the right to live mister.
[02:22.08] Give me back my job again.
[02:22.08] Take the two old parties, mister,
[02:22.08] No difference in them I can see.
[02:22.24] But with a Farmer-Labor party,
[02:22.34] We will set the workers free.
